# The release signing identity stays out of the repository. The distribution
# repository is public, and anyone holding this keystore can sign an APK that
# Android accepts as an in-place upgrade of the installed app. Its companion
# keystore/debug.properties and keystore/bem-debug.keystore, by contrast, are
# tracked on purpose -- a debug identity protects nothing, and pinning it is
# what makes consecutive CI debug APKs installable over one another. See
# README.md, section "Signing".
keystore/release.properties
keystore/bem-release.keystore

